
§§ `s 310-311`

-- s 311: infanticide
-- @fixture `Infanticide 311 via 1` OF `Infanticide Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused is a woman
-- T by an intentional act or omission causes the death of her child
-- T the child is below 12 months of age
-- T the balance of her mind was disturbed by reason of her not having fully recovered from the effect of giving birth to the child
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s section EQUALS "311"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s offence EQUALS "infanticide"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for life, or with imprisonment for a term which may extend to 10 years, and shall, if she is not sentenced to imprisonment for life, also be liable to fine"
#ASSERT NOT ((`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s text EQUALS "")
#ASSERT (`charge under s 311` `Infanticide 311 via 1`)'s refusal EQUALS ""
-- @fixture `Infanticide 311 via 2` OF `Infanticide Facts`
