§§ `s 304C`

-- s 304C(4): causing or allowing death of child below 14 years of age, domestic worker or vulnerable person in same household
-- @fixture `Household Death 304C(4) via 1` OF `Household Death Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T B is below 14 years of age
-- T B dies as a result of an unlawful act
-- T the person who did that act was a member of the same household as B
-- T the person who did that act had frequent contact with B
-- T A was a member of the same household as B
-- T A had frequent contact with B at the time of that act
-- T at that time there was a significant risk of grievous hurt being caused to B by the unlawful act of such a person
-- T A was the person whose act caused B's death
-- @end
