§§ `s 308A`

-- s 308A(2): causing death in furtherance of a group's object
-- @fixture `Group Object Death 308A(2) via 1` OF `Group Object Death Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused is or acts as a member of a group
-- T the accused knows that the common object of the members of the group is to commit an offence under this Code or any written law
-- T the accused knows that death or grievous hurt is likely to be caused in furtherance of the group's common object
-- T the death of a person was caused in furtherance of the group's common object
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 308A(2)` `Group Object Death 308A(2) via 1`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 308A(2)` `Group Object Death 308A(2) via 1`)'s `made out`
